  "notes": "64G Fibre Channel is not an allowed speed step, so ports are modelled at the nearest step (40G) with the real 32/64G rates in speedCaps. The 8 SFP-DD cages each carry two 64G links (thus 64 ports from 56 cages); each cage is listed once and the SFP-DD cage is typed sfp28 because the schema has no SFP-DD connector."
